{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into the circle, Inquisitor. The veil is thin tonight.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whispers Beyond</strong> is a semi-cooperative deduction game set in a dark fantasy world where a restless <strong>Spirit</strong> guides a circle of <strong>Inquisitors</strong> to solve a murder. Uncover the <strong>suspect</strong>, <strong>location</strong>, and <strong>object of fate</strong> by interpreting the Spirit\u2019s <strong>visions</strong> and <strong>whispers</strong>; surreal visual and audio clues that reveal fragments of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together\u2026 but only those who read the signs best will truly see beyond the veil.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your role:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Spirit</strong>: Communicate without words. Send abstract <strong>visions</strong>, offer <strong>whispers</strong> as audio clues, or bestow extra signs to guide the living.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Inquisitor</strong>: Interpret the Spirit\u2019s clues to uncover the truth. Use your <strong>perceptions</strong> to evaluate and wager on others\u2019 choices for an advantage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to 8 players<br>Solo play with AI companions<br>Adjustable difficulty, customize:<strong> </strong>inspirations, perceptions, hand size, timers, and more</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Whisper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979790/dfe8ee688250bd9afcdf0e9b0bdc23d581100973.jpg"},{"name":"Circle Formed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979790/54cd0c70a3222172285d564e5ecdb0aec8584f56.jpg"},{"name":"Bound to the Veil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979790/6c